{"2223980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nomad Drive", "steam_appid": 2223980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/4253ab6a723fc2d38b4e66db689378be.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a procedurally generated post-apocalyptic world. Each new game offers a different starting point and experience, allowing you to collect resources and survive in abandoned locations and roads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/6347a380f1801f8d5eeac857896c5f81.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/83f3beff4c8fbebb2a6d7ca8739d79c3.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey with a rundown RV, repairing and upgrading each part. Personalize everything from stoves and refrigerators to toilets and seating areas, creating your own living space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/2693c389ffde3e9c99151c687fce9ffa.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/2693c389ffde3e9c99151c687fce9ffa.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/2693c389ffde3e9c99151c687fce9ffa.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/4b9f46e60ea0bd08fb154fc63aa192f9.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive with activities such as cooking, fishing, repairing, and making coffee. Use your RV's kitchen to cook the food you find, making more nutritious meals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/8dfb0c23d7a324883b9a609c592c0ac7.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/8dfb0c23d7a324883b9a609c592c0ac7.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/8dfb0c23d7a324883b9a609c592c0ac7.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/fdd7ca694a30a55a0d09b4f314d5d86f.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Nomad Drive, where every part is fully interactive. Touch, customize, and explore everything from furniture to appliances. Make the RV truly yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/a9fca9ebf1f8195bc1498408f3fcae58.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/a9fca9ebf1f8195bc1498408f3fcae58.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/a9fca9ebf1f8195bc1498408f3fcae58.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/c10b8e7e8e5ee430f9d9be70e08a0640.webp?t=1787441402\" width=400 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant the fruit and vegetable seeds you discover in the world of Nomad Drive in pots and grow them by taking care of them. They will reward you with delicious fruits and vegetables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/fe854c42012427564b0067286e023c05.poster.avif?t=1787441402\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/fe854c42012427564b0067286e023c05.webm?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223980/extras/fe854c42012427564b0067286e023c05.mp4?t=1787441402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_im